{'symbol': 'NCLH', 'date': '2023-02-28 07:00:00', 'title': 'NORWEGIAN CRUISE LINE HOLDINGS REPORTS FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR 2022 FINANCIAL RESULTS', 'text': 'MIAMI, FEB. 28, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- NORWEGIAN CRUISE LINE HOLDINGS LTD. (NYSE: NCLH) (TOGETHER WITH NCL CORPORATION LTD., “NORWEGIAN CRUISE LINE HOLDINGS”, “NORWEGIAN” OR THE “COMPANY”) TODAY REPORTED FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR ENDED DECEMBER 31, 2022 AND PROVIDED GUIDANCE FOR THE FIRST QUARTER AND FULL YEAR 2023.'}